],"type":"topic","title":"value"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLStaffSize":{"title":"MXLStaffSize","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLStaffSize","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The staff-size element indicates how large a staff space is on this staff, expressed as a percentage of the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"work’s default scaling. Values less than 100 make the staff space smaller while values over 100 make the staff","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"space larger. A staff-type of cue, ossia, or editorial implies a staff-size of less than 100, but the exact"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value is implementation-dependent unless specified here. Staff size affects staff height only, not the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"relationship of the staff to the left and right margins."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStaffSize","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLStaffSize"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlstaffsize"}}}